WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.712
He taught an AI to speak as the
dead.

00:00:03.099 --> 00:00:04.325
Then he disappeared.

00:00:04.701 --> 00:00:07.658
Now an archivist is reading his
experiments.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.970
Something seems to be reading her.

00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:11.905
Using This Matter.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:13.518
Enter the mystery.
